+"""Exp 4234 verifier-reward LoRA real-training smoke.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-CODE-4234, SCENARIO-CODE-4234-BLOCKED-PRECONDITION,
+SCENARIO-CODE-4234-REAL-TRAINING.
